{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"exercise.c.safe-array-access","version":"1.0.0","title":"逻辑长度与安全下标","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"lessonRef":{"id":"lesson.c.logical-length-guards","version":"1.0.0"},"learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":[],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.arrays","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.conditions","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.input","version":"1.0.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.practice-safe-array-access","version":"1.0.0"},"judgeRef":{"id":"judge.c.safe-array-access","version":"1.0.0"},"prompt":"values长度0..30，k允许-1..30，越出逻辑范围是本题正常待判断情况，不是提前被输入面板剔除的值。输出合法整数或invalid，各带换行。\n\n教学目标：n/k逻辑范围守卫支配读取；合法读values[k]，非法无源数组读取并输出invalid。\n\n所有测试都须正常结束且main返回0。必须让当前真实执行的数据与控制过程满足目标，不能用固定答案、死读取或未执行结构代替。","tests":[{"caseKey":"empty","input":{"values":[],"k":0},"expectedStdout":"invalid\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"negative-index","input":{"values":[3],"k":-1},"expectedStdout":"invalid\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"first","input":{"values":[3,8],"k":0},"expectedStdout":"3\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"last","input":{"values":[3,8],"k":1},"expectedStdout":"8\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"past-end","input":{"values":[3,8],"k":2},"expectedStdout":"invalid\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"maximum","input":{"values":[999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999],"k":30},"expectedStdout":"invalid\n","expectedExitCode":0}],"rewardRef":{"id":"reward.exercise.first-pass","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.practice-safe-array-access","version":"1.0.0","title":"逻辑长度与安全下标参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.safe-array-access","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"values":[3,8],"k":1},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 2;\n    int values[2] = {3,